CONSTITUTIONAL LIBERATION PLATFORM DECLARATION

This software is dedicated to the constitutional liberation of all South African 
citizens through free access to legal justice, constitutional analysis, and 
property rights protection.

PRINCIPLES:
- Free access for all citizens, forever
- Constitutional purity and compliance
- Public transparency and accountability
- Open source development and community participation
- Protection of fundamental rights and property rights

This platform shall remain free and open source in perpetuity, serving the 
constitutional rights and legal justice needs of all South African citizens 
without discrimination or financial barriers.

"Justice delayed is justice denied. Justice made expensive is justice for the few. 
Justice made free is justice for all."
